  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.3031 deals with potential identifiers pertinent to networks envisioned in Recommendation ITU-T Y.3001. It presents a review analysis of user, data, service, node and location identifiers being used in current networks and projects related to future networks (FNs). Details of the review are in the appendix. It then specifies the identification framework and general requirements of these identifiers in future networks.</abstract>
